      "kind": "conflict",
      "title": "The Bramble Gate",
      "prose": "Goblins and a lean, hungry wolf hold the thorned gate, snapping at anyone who tries to pass toward the hidden valley beyond.",
      "art": "art-the-hollow-span-reckoning-goblin-bramble-gate",
